<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 16,000 T U.S. corn for Rwanda.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 16,000 T U.S. corn for Rwanda.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it is seeking up to 16,000 tonnes U.S. No.2 or better yellow corn, maximum moisture 14.5 percent under the export donation program to Rwanda.</p>
<p>Shipment period is set for December 5-30 and offers are due by September 24.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
